From: changdy
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8450-oneplus-negroni: disable USB2 gadget LPM

Experiment for the USB debug gadget: when the phone acts as a USB device it
enumerates on the PC but drops after ~3 s and only reaches full-speed. DCFG
reads 0x00e00804 (LPMCap set). The vendor waipio DT sets
snps,usb2-gadget-lpm-disable on the same DWC3 core. Add only that property.

---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8450-oneplus-negroni.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8450-oneplus-negroni.dts
@@ -1654,3 +1654,4 @@ &usb_1 {
 	maximum-speed = "super-speed";
+	snps,usb2-gadget-lpm-disable;
 	status = "okay";
 };
